{"id":"898681611f432286","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-small-category.md","title":"Definition — Small Category","display":"Definition — Small Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-small-category","aliases":["14-df-small-category"],"display":"Definition — Small Category","depends_on":["[[14-df-category]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-small-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-small-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Small Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a> 固定的 Grothendieck 宇宙。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 是候选范畴数据；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsCategory}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ob}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ob}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"28211adc1b0ce5bc\" href=\"?note=28211adc1b0ce5bc\" title=\"14-df-category\">14-df-category</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}\">\\(\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}\\)</span> 是本条定义的相对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 小性谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal U\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{IsSmallCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal U\\land\\mathrm{Mor}(\\mathcal C)\\in\\mathcal U\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：Categorical Preliminaries；I.1。</p>\n<p>小是相对于固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 而言；集合范畴和预层范畴通常仅是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span>-小。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal U\\in\\mathcal V$ 是 [[14-df-category]] 固定的 Grothendieck 宇宙。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"28211adc1b0ce5bc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 是候选范畴数据；$\\mathrm{IsCategory}$、$\\mathrm{Ob}$ 与 $\\mathrm{Mor}$ 见 [[14-df-category]]。","embed":false}],"attach